# The synthetic corpus is generated, deterministically, from a seed:
#   python -m engine.generate --seed 7 --size 80
# Committing 160 PNGs and a 2.4 MB embeddings file would put 18 MB of
# reproducible output in version control. The seed is what matters, and it
# lives in the code.
data/

